# ACC-FL-ROS-01 · Modern Rose de Mai v1.0

A contemporary Rose de Mai skeleton that combines natural rose texture with phenethyl softness, citronellol-geraniol freshness, damascone bloom and clean diffusion.

**Category:** Floral  
**Recommended use:** 2–10% of perfume concentrate  
**Maturation:** 10–21 days  
**Monte Carlo pass:** 100.00%  
**Design score:** 100.00/100  
**Outcome:** `COMPUTATIONAL ACCORD DESIGN PASS`

